tags.description:
Примеры ботов для обращений к методам Retail API.

## C# 

```c# 
using System.Net;
using RestSharp;  // <PackageReference Include="RestSharp" Version="108.0.*" /> 

class Program
{
    private const string RetailApiUrl = "https://retail-api.ozon.ru";
    private const string OzonIdApiUrl = "https://id.ozon.ru";

    private const string ClientId = "<YourClientId>";          // the credentials
    private const string ClientSecret = "<YourClientSecret>";  // you got at RetailCenter portal
    private const string GrantType = "client_credentials";     // leave this constant please

    public static async Task Main(string[] args)
    {
        Console.WriteLine("Let's rock!");

        var success = false;

        // let's acquire access token from OzonID first
        // then do request to RetailAPI with the token
        // in case of HttpStatusCode.Unauthorized response
        // all we can do is acquire token one more time
        do
        {
            // let's get a new access token from OzonID by the credentials
            var token = await AcquireAccessToken(ClientId, ClientSecret, GrantType);

            // yoo-hoo we got a token! now we're ready to make a data request
            using (var client = new RestClient(RetailApiUrl))
            {
                var request = new RestRequest("/v1/orders/new", Method.Get);

                // access token is a standard JWT and is supposed to be in the Authorization HTTP header
                request.AddHeader("Authorization", $"Bearer {token.AccessToken}");

                // let's request Retail API new order list method using the access token
                var newOrderResponse = await client.ExecuteAsync<IEnumerable<Order>>(request);

                // "unathorized" status code means the access token is expired in most cases
                if (newOrderResponse.StatusCode != HttpStatusCode.Unauthorized)
                {
                    success = true;

                    // the simplest we can do with the data retrieved is print it out!
                    foreach (var order in newOrderResponse.Data)
                    {
                        Console.WriteLine(
                            $"OrderId: {order.OrderId}, by {order.DocumentNumber}, from {order.DocumentDate:dd.MM.yyyy}");
                    }
                }
            }
        // if we're not success let's acquire the access token
        // and do the data request again
        } while (!success);                                                                   

        Console.WriteLine("That's all folks!");
    }

    /// <summary>
    /// Get a new access token from OzonID by credentials
    /// </summary>
    /// <param name="clientId">client_id you got at RetailCenter</param>
    /// <param name="clientSecret">client_id you got at RetailCenter</param>
    /// <param name="grantType">just pass 'client_credentials'</param>
    /// <returns>A model that contains both access token and its expiration time (in seconds)</returns>
    private static async Task<TokenResponse> AcquireAccessToken(string clientId, string clientSecret, string grantType)
    {
        using (var client = new RestClient(OzonIdApiUrl))
        {
            var request = new RestRequest("/oauth/token", Method.Post);

            // OzonID accepts only good-old 'application/x-www-form-urlencoded'
            request.AddHeader("Content-Type", "application/x-www-form-urlencoded");                         
            request.AddBody($"client_id={clientId}&client_secret={clientSecret}&grant_type={grantType}",
                contentType: "application/x-www-form-urlencoded");

            var response = await client.ExecuteAsync<TokenResponse>(request);
            CheckResponse(response);

            return response.Data;
        }
    }

    private static void CheckResponse(RestResponse<TokenResponse> response)
    {
        if (response.StatusCode == HttpStatusCode.Forbidden)
        {
            // you need to add your new real IP address to the ClientId related record in RetailCenter portal
            throw new Exception("IP address is not allowed! Please add your address into the list");            
        }

        if (response.StatusCode == HttpStatusCode.Unauthorized)
        {
            // it's better to generate a new ClientId/ClientSecret pair in RetailCenter portal
            // please don't forget to add your real IP address while generating the pair
            throw new Exception("Either client_id or client_secret is incorrect! Please generate a new one");   
        }

        if (response.StatusCode != HttpStatusCode.OK)
        {
            // something went wrong, please ask support in this case
            throw new Exception($"Unknown error occured: {response.StatusCode}, details: {response.Content}");
        }
    }
}
```

```c#
public class TokenResponse
{
    [JsonPropertyName("access_token")]
    public string AccessToken { get; set; }

    // you can use this value to detect if the access token you had retrieved and stored
    // is already expired, so you won't get one more "unathorized" RetailAPI response
    [JsonPropertyName("expires_in")]
    public int ExpiresInSeconds { get; set; }

    [JsonPropertyName("scope")]
    public string Scope { get; set; }

    [JsonPropertyName("token_type")]
    public string TokenType { get; set; }
}

public class Order
{
    public long OrderId { get; set; }
    public string DocumentNumber { get; set; }
    public DateTime DocumentDate { get; set; }
    public string State { get; set; }
}
```

## Python

### main.py

```python
from functions import acquire_access_token, get_new_orders
import time

retail_api_url = 'https://retail-api.ozon.ru'
ozon_id_api_url = 'https://id.ozon.ru'
client_id = '<YourClientId>'  # the credentials
client_secret = '<YourClientSecret>'  # you got at RetailCenter portal
grant_type = 'client_credentials'  # leave this constant please

print("Let's rock!")

# let's acquire access token from OzonID first
# then do request to RetailAPI with the token
# in case of HttpStatusCode.Unauthorized response
# all we can do is acquire token one more time

# let's get a new access token from OzonID by the credentials
token_response = acquire_access_token(ozon_id_api_url, client_id, client_secret, grant_type)

# yoo-hoo we got a token! now we're ready to make a data request

# detect if the access token you had retrieved and stored is already expired
if token_response.create_time + token_response.expires_in_seconds < time.time():
    token_response = acquire_access_token(ozon_id_api_url, client_id, client_secret, grant_type)
new_orders_response = get_new_orders(retail_api_url, token_response.access_token)
```

### TokenResponse.py

```python
class TokenResponse:
    # response of acquire_access_token()
    # {
    #    'access_token': '',
    #    'expires_in': 3599,
    #    'scope': '',
    #    'token_type': 'bearer'
    # }
    def __init__(self, access_token, expires_in_seconds, scope, token_type, create_time):
        self.access_token = access_token
        self.expires_in_seconds = expires_in_seconds
        self.scope = scope
        self.token_type = token_type
        self.create_time = create_time
```

### functions.py

```python
import requests
from http import HTTPStatus
import time
from TokenResponse import TokenResponse
from requests import RequestException


# response of acquire_access_token()
# {
#    'access_token': '',
#    'expires_in': 3599,
#    'scope': '',
#    'token_type': 'bearer'
# }
def acquire_access_token(ozon_id_api_url: str, client_id: str, client_secret: str, grant_type: str) -> TokenResponse:
    data = {"client_id": client_id,
            "client_secret": client_secret,
            "grant_type": grant_type
            }
    headers = {
        "Content-Type": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded"
    }
    path = '/oauth/token'
    full_url = ozon_id_api_url + path
    try:
        response = requests.post(url=full_url, data=data, headers=headers)
        check_response(response)
        response_json = response.json()
        return TokenResponse(response_json['access_token'], response_json['expires_in'], response_json['scope'],
                             response_json['token_type'], time.time())
    except RequestException as e:
        raise Exception("Error occurred while executing API request:", e)
    except ValueError as e:
        raise Exception("Error occurred while reading JSON:", e)


# response of get_new_orders()
# [
#   {
#    'orderId': 0,
#    'documentNumber': '',
#    'documentDate': '2022-11-28T00:00:00',
#    'state': 'RetailOnConfirmation',
#    'storageWarehouseId': 0,
#    'supplyWarehouseId': 0
#    }
#   ]
def get_new_orders(retail_api_url: str, access_token: str) -> list[dict]:
    path = '/v1/orders/new'
    headers = {"Authorization": f"Bearer {access_token}"}
    full_url = retail_api_url + path
    try:
        response = requests.get(url=full_url, headers=headers)
        check_response(response)
        for order in response.json():
            print(f'OrderId: {order["orderId"]}, by {order["documentNumber"]}, from {order["documentDate"]}')
        return response.json()
    except RequestException as e:
        raise Exception("Error occurred while executing API request:", e)


def check_response(response: requests.Response) -> None:
    if response.status_code == HTTPStatus.FORBIDDEN:
        # you need to add your new real IP address to the ClientId related record in RetailCenter portal
        raise Exception("IP address is not allowed! Please add your address into the list")
    elif response.status_code == HTTPStatus.UNAUTHORIZED:
        # it's better to generate a new ClientId/ClientSecret pair in RetailCenter portal
        # please don't forget to add your real IP address while generating the pair
        raise Exception("Either client_id or client_secret is incorrect! Please generate a new one")
    elif response.status_code != HTTPStatus.OK:
        # something went wrong, please ask support in this case
        raise Exception(f"Unknown error occurred: {response.status_code}, details: {response.content}")
```

## 1С

Для интеграции Retail API в 1С используйте комплект модулей [Ozon Retail API SDK (CF)](https://cdn.ozone.ru/s3/ozon-disk-api/techdoc/retail-api/ozon-retail-api-sdk-v0_1_1736424109.zip).
Совместимо с 1С версии 8.3.16 и выше.

isXdock.description:
Признак кросс-докинга:
- `true` — поставка через кросс-докинг;
- `false` — прямая поставка.

vehicleNumber.description:
Номер автомобиля. Количество символов — от 4 до 19. Маски нет.
Допускаются:
- цифры;
- латинские буквы;
- русские буквы, имеющие графические аналоги в латинском алфавите: А, В, Е, К, М, Н, О, Р, С, Т, У, Х.

WaybillState.description:
Статус загруженного файла:
- `ValidatingFormat` — проверка формата файла;
- `ValidatingContent` — проверка содержания;
- `ProcessedWithErrors` — в файле есть ошибки;
- `Accepted` — принят;
- `Cancelled` — УПД отменён;
- `SendDeletionRequest` — отправлен запрос на удаление;
- `Deleted` — удалён.

CantBeDeletedReasonResponse.description:
- `OrderInInvalidState` — файл с таким статусом заказа удалить нельзя;
- `WaybillFileInInvalidState` — файл с таким статусом удалить нельзя;
- `LastValidWaybillCannotBeDeleted` — до начала поставки осталось меньше 30 минут;
- `WaybillFileAlreadyDeleted` — файл уже удалён;
- `WaybillIsEdo` — файл передан по ЭДО.
